= Stefanie Hubig

Dr. Stefanie Hubig, a lawyer and former education minister of Rhineland-Palatinate, became federal minister of justice in 2025.

- @judiciary_
- @constitutional_reform_
- @root: Return to main

@judiciary_
title: Justice and the rule of law
subtitle: Use the justice ministry.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if justice_minister_party != "SPD" or spd_in_government == 0 : The SPD does not hold the justice ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and spd_in_government and justice_minister_party = "SPD"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; judiciary_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: judiciary

@constitutional_reform_
title: Constitutional reform
subtitle: Prepare a change to the Basic Law.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if justice_minister_party != "SPD" or spd_in_government == 0 : The SPD does not hold the justice ministry. ?][? if judicial_reform < 2 : We must reform the justice system first. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and spd_in_government and justice_minister_party = "SPD" and judicial_reform >= 2
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; constitutional_reform_timer -= 12
